mainnet-usdcx-transfer-preapproval.b64

A prepared transaction for a USDCx transfer on Canton MainNet, copied unchanged
from the x402 project:

  https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402
  typescript/packages/mechanisms/canton/src/__fixtures__/mainnet-usdcx-transfer-preapproval.b64
  commit c5bed45f7e461677642ed862108a4a078b8ad2c9

It was never signed and its deadline has passed. The tests that verify it sign
its hash with a throwaway key, which verify accepts because the caller supplies
the payer's keys, and pin the clock inside its deadline.

